(circle at 74% 38%, #e49b29 0 13%, transparent 14%),\n        radial-gradient(circle at 27% 34%, #d77925 0 12%, transparent 13%),\n        linear-gradient(145deg, #fbf2d5, #ead7aa);\n    }\n\n    @media (max-width: 540px) {\n      .page {\n        width: calc(100vw - 24px);\n        margin: 12px auto;\n        padding-left: 9px;\n        padding-right: 9px;\n      }\n\n      .entry {\n        grid-template-columns: 100px 1fr;\n        column-gap: 10px;\n      }\n\n      .visual,\n      .placeholder {\n        width: 100px;\n      }\n\n      .label {\n        font-size: 16px;\n      }\n\n      .text {\n        font-size: 14px;\n        line-height: 1.58;\n      }\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"page\">\n    <section class=\"entry\">\n      <div class=\"visual\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[Image]</div>\n        <div class=\"label\">卡里颂糖</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"text\">\n        Calissons卡里颂糖是一种传统的法国糖果，由光滑、淡黄色、均匀的蜜馅（尤其是甜瓜和橙子）和杏仁粉组成，上面覆盖着一层薄薄的糖霜。它们的质地类似于杏仁软糖，但具有更浓郁的果味和明显的甜瓜味。通常呈杏仁状，长约五厘米。\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"entry\">\n      <div class=\"visual\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[Image]</div>\n        <div class=\"label\">里昂枕形巧克力</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"text\">\n        Coussin de Lyon是里昂高级手工巧克力，绿色外皮是杏仁泥，中间有深色包裹的甜馅，内馅是调了些许橙酒的黑巧克力馅。以用杏仁和巧克力、柑橘清香闻名于世。\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"entry\">\n      <div class=\"visual\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[Image]</div>\n        <div class=\"label\">漂浮岛</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"text\">\n        île flottante 这个具有神秘又有趣名称的甜品是法国经典甜品之一。白的胖胖的蛋清浮在蛋奶做成的英式卡仕达酱上，就像是一座无人小岛。可爱又美味。\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"entry\">\n      <div class=\"visual\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[Image]</div>\n        <div class=\"label\">柠檬塔</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"text\">\n        Tarte au citron，一款历史悠久的美食，从南法城市Menton开始流行。每年的二、三月都会举办柠檬节，城中以柠檬与鲜花制作的花车游行最为盛名。在塔皮挤入柠檬奶油，再以蛋白饼或蛋白霜装饰，是现在常见的柠檬塔形式。\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"entry\">\n      <div class=\"visual\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[Image]</div>\n        <div class=\"label\">红酒炖梨</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"text\">\n        Poire à la Beaujolaise，法国博若莱葡萄酒产区的传统甜点，果味红酒搭配蜜糖或蜂蜜、丁香、胡椒、香草等香料炖煮梨，梨充分入味、甜软飘香。\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>"
